  "method": "Each entry was read from the package's published wheel on PyPI (entry_points.txt console_scripts). Servers launch with `uvx --from <pypi> <script>`, so each runs in its own isolated environment; this also avoids top-level module collisions between packages. Each launch also passes `--with mcp<2`: all 41 packages declare `mcp>=1.28.0` with no upper bound, and mcp 2.0.0 (28 Jul 2026) renamed FastMCP, so an unguarded fresh install fails at import. Remove the guard per server once that package is republished with `mcp<2` or migrated to mcp 2.",
